    {
      "title": "Easy does it Cowl",
      "slug": "easy-does-it-cowl",
      "displayOrder": 1,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 848,
        "lessonOrder": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Let's explore this unique cowl - a project that goes beyond a plain 'ol rectangle. The extended triangle design tucks perfectly into your coat or vest for extra warmth, while serving as a canvas to develop your machine knitting skills and confidence.\r\n\r\nAs you create this practical piece, you'll master essential skills:<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Establishing accurate gauge</li>\r\n<li>Pattern reading and execution </li>\r\n<li>Scrapping on</li>\r\n<li>Full fashioned decreasing</li>\r\n<li>Professional binding off</li>\r\n<li>Clean, precise seaming</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\nI'll guide you through each technique with detailed, start-to-finish instruction that will help both new and experienced knitters. By the end, you'll have both improved skills and a beautiful, wearable cowl you'll be proud to wear and share.",
              "legacyComponentId": 9850,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Introduction",
          "slug": "introduction",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 6405,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
