      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\n\r\n\r\nWith this simple cowl shape,  you have complete control over the size you will knit.<br>Click the button, \"Customize your pattern\" and check all 3 measurements.<br><ol>\r\n<li>Double Check your measurements</li>\r\n<li>Enter YOUR gauge</li>\r\n<li>Let us do the math to create your CUSTOM pattern</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<br>\r\n <a class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"KIN_Pattern_overview\" data-vimeoid=\"772256112\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Are you new to Knit it Now Patterns?\"</a>\r\n\r\n<figure><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/128/measure_neck1.jpg\">\r\n<figcaption align=\"center\">Use a tape measure to confirm the depth of the cowl</figcaption>\r\n</figure>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n\r\nWith this pattern, you have complete control over the size you will knit.<br>Click the button, \"Customize your pattern\" and check all 3 measurements.<br><ol>\r\n<li>Double Check your measurements <em>(don't forget negative ease)</em></li>\r\n<li>Enter YOUR gauge</li>\r\n<li>Let us do the math to create your CUSTOM pattern</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<br>\r\n <a class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"KIN_Pattern_overview\" data-vimeoid=\"772256112\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Are you new to Knit it Now Patterns?\"</a>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">",
